{
	"Site": "Nexus",
	"Id": 24980,
	"Name": "(AT) Garden Pots to Modular Garden Planters",
	"Author": "Birbeton",
	"Description": "I made this for my own Gameplay, decided to publish in case someone else is looking for something similar :)\n<br />_________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n<br />July, 09: Update 2.0.0 \n<br />-Name Change, please delete the old folder\n<br />-Edited Textures a bit\n<br />-Added 3x3 Pieces\n<br />-Added additional Corner Pieces \n<br />-Added Keywords to every Piece\n<br />   \uFEFF[b]Base Set 1x3 Planters (Does not need any of ther other \"addons\")[/b]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Search by Flavor: Dark, Orange, Pink, White\n<br />   \uFEFF- Search by alignment: Single, Horizontal, Vertical\n<br />   \uFEFF- Other Keyword: [u]Base[/u]\n<br />[b]   Base Set \uFEFF3x3 Planters [/b][b](Does not need any of ther other \"addons\")[/b]\n<br />   - Search by Color: Dark, Orange, Pink, White\n<br />   \uFEFF- Search by alignment: Left, Right, Middle, Top, Bottom, Corner\n<br />   \uFEFF- Pack Keyword:[u]3x3[/u]\n<br />[b]   \uFEFFCorner Addon (Additonal Corners, you do need one or both of the \"Base\" Planters)[/b]\n<br />   - Search by Color: Dark, Orange, Pink, White\n<br />   \uFEFF- Search by alignment: Left, Right, Top, Bottom, [u]Outer, Inner[/u]\n<br />   \uFEFF- Pack Keyword: Outer, Inner\n<br />[b]\n<br />Please choose the Main Files with All four color[u] or[/u] pick the spefic packs and sets from the optional files.[/b]\n<br />\n<br />Please Note: They will work like regular Garden Pots, if you want to use the Pots with sprinklers, Ancient fruit or get the Pot earlier trought Hearts I Recommend \n<br />this Mod: [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/21608]\"Garden Pot Options\" \n<br />\n<br />[/url][b]In that sense als little PSA[/b], if you use the 3x3 Set, the Game won´t let you plant, water and harvest the middle Crop/tile. If you use regrowable Plants like corn, use a mod that lets you harvest with the scythe and a upgraded watering can. \n<br />\n<br />Same Thing happens if you place &gt;2 Pots next to eachother, please make sure you can acces it from at least one side or diagonle. \n<br />\n<br />\n<br />______________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________________\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />\n<br />Other Mods seen in Screenshot: \n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/20329](AT) Greenhouse Set[/url]\uFEFF - For the Glasswall \n<br />[url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/15250]Aimon's Fancy Shed (aka Redesigned Shed Layout)[/url] - for the Shed redesgin\n<br />\n<br />____________\n<br />\n<br />Edit: For Transparency - I noticed after finishing, that there is a modular Planter Set in Orangeblossoms Greenhouse Set - so all my work was basically for nothing lol. Anyway I will still keep it up \n<br />\n<br />In that sense: You should also check out the Greenhouse Set - it gorgeous",
	"PageUrl": "https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/24980",
